{{Quote|It looks like the Sandpeople did this, all right. Look. There's gaffi sticks, bantha tracks.|Luke Skywalker|<ref name="Episode IV">{{Film|IV}}</ref>}}
A '''gaderffii stick''', also known simply as a '''gaderffii''' or '''gaffi stick''', was a bladed [[club]] used by the [[Tusken Raider]]s.<ref name="SWE">{{SWE|groups|tuskenraiders|Tusken Raiders}}</ref> They were used to jab and pummel their victims.<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|gaderffii-stick|Gaderffii Stick}}</ref> The bent end of a gaderffii, called the ''traang'' in [[Tusken]], could be doused with [[sand bat]] [[Sand bat venom|venom]], which had paralyzing properties.<ref name="Rites">{{StoryCite|story=Rites|book=From a Certain Point of View}}</ref> Though a primitive [[weapon]], it could be extremely [[Death|deadly]] in the right hands.<ref name="Chapter 14">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 14: The Tragedy}}</ref> The weapon also served as a tool for more mundane tasks, such as cleaning the [[Tooth|teeth]] of a [[bantha]].<ref name="Chapter 9">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 9: The Marshal}}</ref>

==History==
[[File:TuskenRaider-SWApp.png|thumb|left|200px|A Tusken Raider wielding their gaderffii stick.]]
While [[Luke Skywalker]] was searching for the wandering [[astromech droid]] [[R2-D2]] in the [[Jundland Wastes]], he got a close look at the gaderffii of a bellicose Tusken named [[A'Koba]].<ref name="Episode IV" />

In [[5 ABY]],<ref name="Chapter 2 Date">{{InsiderCite|225|A Certain Point of View}} states that flashback events of "[[Chapter 2: The Tribes of Tatooine]]" took place five [[Standard year|years]] after the events of {{Film|IV}}, corresponding to [[5 ABY]] according to ''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''.</ref> while on [[Tatooine]], former [[bounty hunter]] [[Boba Fett]] trained in the use of the gaderffii stick after he joined the ranks of a [[Unidentified Tusken Raider tribe|Tusken tribe]]. After leading the [[raid on a Pyke repulsortrain]], Fett earned the right to wield a [[Boba Fett's gaderffii stick|gaderffii stick]] of his own, which he crafted himself in the [[Gaderffii stick workshop]]. He used a branch of a [[wortwood tree]] that he found in the [[desert]] and made it with the help of a [[Unidentified Tusken Raider craftsman|craftsman]], who utilized a [[Tusken Adze]].<ref name="Chapter 2" />

He carried this stick on his back<ref name="Chapter 9" /> in [[9 ABY]]<ref name="MandoDate">{{MandoDate|9}}</ref> as [[Din Djarin]] left [[Freetown|Mos Pelgo]] following [[Mission to Tatooine (Din Djarin)|his exploits]] in aiding the townspeople.<ref name="Chapter 9" /> Fett later [[Battle of Tython (9 ABY)|wielded]] the weapon on [[Tython]] against [[stormtrooper]]s with brutal efficiency, piercing through and shattering their [[Stormtrooper armor|armor]] with it.<ref name="Chapter 14" /> Fett later attempted to utilize it while being [[Assassination attempt on Boba Fett|attacked]] by [[Krrsantan]].<ref name="Chapter 3">{{BOBF|Chapter 3: The Streets of Mos Espa}}</ref> Later, he used the weapon to kill [[Cad Bane]].<ref name="Chapter 7">{{BOBF|Chapter 7: In the Name of Honor}}</ref>

